      "message": "It would make sense to validate this input and return `NoSuchPartition` if it doesn\u0027t match the (currently unique) expected name. In particular, you could define the constant somewhere it can be shared (e.g. `Payload::KERNEL_PARTITION_NAME`) and also use it to populate the `requested_partitions` to `avb_slot_verify`. Then, when we start supporting multiple partitions, we\u0027ll simply add more constants and `match` the input here.",
